# Copy to .env.local and fill in your Supabase project's values (Settings > API).
# These are inlined into the client bundle at build time -- that's expected, the
# anon key is safe to expose publicly; access control is enforced by RLS policies
# in supabase/migrations, not by keeping this value secret.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
